  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madagascar First Equitable and Resilient Growth Development Policy Operation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program Development Objective is: (i) strengthening governance and climate-smart and decentralized fiscal management, and (ii) fostering an enabling investment environment and supporting structural reforms in key sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the First Equitable and Resilient Growth Development Policy Operation (DPO) for Madagascar is: (i) strengthening governance and climate-smart and decentralized fiscal management, and (ii) fostering an enabling investment environment and supporting structural reforms in key sectors. The DPO will be anchored in two mutually reinforcing pillars: (i) strengthening the governance and macro-fiscal frameworks including through climate smart fiscal and decentralized management; and (ii) enhancing the enabling investment environment and deepening.</narrative>
  </description>
